        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I'm somewhat new to Sentinels and I couldn't find an answer to this anywhere...\r\n\r\nI have the game on Android and I've been going through the One-Shots for fun, minting the new ones and collecting the past ones.\r\n\r\nAny time I have to reinstall the game or clear the game data, however, my progress is lost and I have to re-attempt all the ones I've already completed.\r\n\r\nIs there a way to sync my progress with my Google Play account? Is there something else I'm missing?\r\n\r\nThis has happened a few times now and it's very discouraging and I don't really see the point of continuing to try and collect the covers.",
